	(descr "Wuerth 68714014022 WR-FPC 40-pin 0.5 mm ZIF, horizontal, top contact, 2.1 mm height. Pads north of the body, pin 1 west, cable enters from the south (Wuerth land pattern orientation); place on the back and KiCad mirrors it to the EVKB J48 arrangement. Land pattern = EVKB J48 (IPC-D-356) = Wuerth recommended pattern. FPC enters from -Y; pin 1 at -X when the solder-lead row (+Y) is at the back")
